    "Bratislava: 1801 Pozsony/Pressburg ko 포조니, 1849-10-24 Pressburg/Pozsony ko 프레스부르크, 1867-07-28 Pozsony/Pressburg ko 포조니 (preferred-first period-nativeNames, not legally coequal names). English Pressburg throughout pre-1919. Official Bratislava/브라티슬라바 and English Bratislava from 1919-03-27. 1860-10-20 Hungarian administrative restoration is historical event only, not a label switch.",
