    "Ancient/medieval fortress references (Lucilinburhuc) and the medieval origin of Vaduz are historical context, not additional modern city objects.",
    "Historical survey from 1801 is editorial coverage, not founding date nor proof the selected 1801 Korean/English form was recorded that exact year; the 1804 English Kischenau example and later imperial Russian name are deliberately projected to editorial thresholds with provenance.",
    "All shortDescriptionKo and UI-facing note/detail values are limited to 28 Unicode code points; longer source material is saved in researchNote/researchDetail.",
    "Cities are review-stage only: no PLAC tile/search shard, runtime manifest, or application main branch changed."
